    h_secs: 'Sections and joints', h_secs_p: 'A motion can have several sections, each with its time interval. A section is given by s(t), by v(t) plus the initial position, by a(t) plus initial position and velocity, or by constant s₀, v₀ and a. Initial conditions can continue from the previous section. Between two sections, the joint tells you whether the motion is physically possible.',
